  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 2 of MONGODB AGGREGATION. Your aggregation is slow for one reason: something before the first $match changed the shape of your documents, and the index quietly stopped applying. This field handbook walks all ten stages — $match, $group, $project, $unwind, $lookup and friends — with the cost model, the memory caps, and the explain() signals that tell you which stage is actually burning the milliseconds. Ten pages, one per chapter, every gotcha written down so you stop rediscovering them in production.",
